QUESTION: Who was the most consistent driver in the 2024 races?
== run 1 ==
  step 1 SQL: SELECT r.Abbreviation, ds.full_name, COUNT(*) as races, STDDEV_SAMP(r.Position) as stddev_pos
FROM results r
JOIN driver_seasons ds ON r.Abbreviation = ds.driver_code AND r.season = ds.season
WHERE r.session = 'R' AND r.Position IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY r.Abbreviation, ds.full_name
ORDER BY stddev_pos ASC
LIMIT 10;
