steps=1 ANSWER: "The driver with the lowest standard deviation of finishing positions across the 24 2024 races was **Valtteri Bottas**.  \nHis standard deviation of race positions was **2.22**, the smallest value among all drivers who completed races that season. This indicates that Bottas’ finishing positions varied the least from race to race, making him the most consistent performer in the 2024 season."
